        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we believe the development of independent asset managers contributes to an increase in secondary market liquidity, helping to democratize access to investment products to more Brazilians.",
        "start_character": 5095,
        "end_character": 5296
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had a services agreement with a data center service provider for the provision of data services to us from its data centers in the cities of Barueri and Santana do Parnaíba, in the State of São Paulo, Brazil (which are located approximately five miles apart).",
        "start_character": 209291,
        "end_character": 209578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, in just a few years we were able to build an advisory distribution network, a Retail Liquidity Provider (RLP) service, an Investment Banking business, one of the fastest growing pension insurers in Brazil, a premium credit card and a global investment platform.",
        "start_character": 48757,
        "end_character": 49031
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our IFA partners benefit from our suite of financial products, education tools, and the IFA-specific applications that we developed to help them build and grow their businesses, and we benefit from their abilities to reach and cultivate new clients.",
        "start_character": 20385,
        "end_character": 20634
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our open product platform, which we believe is a pioneer in the market and is the most complete among Brazilian players, combines: (i) a wide network of third party partners such as independent asset managers, medium-sized banks and insurance companies;",
        "start_character": 47044,
        "end_character": 47297
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the last 20 years, we have developed a differentiated set of capabilities and attributes in our business that we believe provide us with meaningful strategic advantages and have helped us to disintermediate the legacy models of traditional financial institutions.",
        "start_character": 46632,
        "end_character": 46900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the years, we have been able to consistently innovate, develop our technology solutions and evolve our proprietary business model in several integrated phases that have complemented each other and compounded our capabilities.",
        "start_character": 11453,
        "end_character": 11683
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Risks Relating to Our Business and Industry—If We Cannot Make the Necessary Investments to Keep Pace with Rapid Developments and Change in Our Industry, the Use of Our Services Could Decline, Reducing Our Revenues,” and “Item 3.",
        "start_character": 93169,
        "end_character": 93410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The incumbent banks control the majority of the debt market and typically steers clients to bank issued term loans or limited fixed income products that are sold to their asset management businesses, which we believe limits the amount of available credit in the market and fosters an environment for higher costs due to limited competition.",
        "start_character": 36410,
        "end_character": 36750
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The markets for our solutions continue to evolve and are competitive in the asset classes, products and geographies in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 91935,
        "end_character": 92071
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000182",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also want to offer white label solutions for partners, with a Broker as a service business.",
        "start_character": 54172,
        "end_character": 54266
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000182-fe4325150f4a550c",
